id: demon-clansman
name: Demon Clansman
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's) - its Prerequisite and its loss as the
# Alignment turns, the table's.
requirement: Any
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: >
  To obtain this Factor, a Character must be Pure Evil. If a Character with this Factor's alignment turns to Good or Pure Good, they lose this Factor and regain the Racial Trait they exchanged for this Factor's Factor Trait
description: >
  Though not necessarily a demon by blood, the darkness of demonic evil fills your heart and flows through your veins, transforming you into a demon yourself.
